        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jairos Jiri, John David McPhun\n- Places: Salisbury, Southern Africa\n- Organizations: Currie Cup\n- Topics: disability services, rugby union\n\nFacts:\n- In the 1940s, Jairos Jiri created facilities for disadvantaged and disabled people in a Southern African state.\n- Salisbury was the capital of that Southern African state.\n- In 1996, the Currie Cup was hosted in that state.\n- John David McPhun played in the 1996 Currie Cup.",
